**Known for**: Open Source Initiative (disgraced co-founder); "The Cathedral
and the Bazaar" 

**Alias**: esr

Eric is a creepy weird guy who writes racist, homophobic, and misogynist
screeds everywhere he can. His uses his blog, "Armed and Dangerous; Sex,
software, politics, and firearms. Life's simple pleasures…", to advocate for
weird right-wing politics, such as strident support for Kyle
Rittenhouse[[source]][0] and threatening to shoot communists.[[source]][1] He
said gay men deserved to get AIDS because of "unfettered
promiscuity",[[source]][2] quotes racist talking points about police
violence,[[source]][3] and says organizations that try to get women more
involved in FOSS are trying to entrap men with rape accusations.[[source]][4]
See also Eric's essay on "Preventing visceral racism".[[source]][5]

Eric got kicked out of the OSI mailing lists for being a huge asshole back in
2020.[[source]][6]

